1
00:00:00,034 --> 00:00:02,494
(Howard:)Come on. The man torments me.

2
00:00:02,662 --> 00:00:05,372
I'm letting him have a little taste
of his own medicine.

3
00:00:05,540 --> 00:00:09,630
It's not the same. Sheldon doesn't know
he's being mean. The part of his brain...

4
00:00:09,794 --> 00:00:13,134
(Bernadette:)...that should know is getting a wedgie
from the rest of his brain.

5
00:00:16,009 --> 00:00:19,139
(Howard:)Fine. I'll just make him do
a couple more things, then I'll stop.

6
00:00:19,637 --> 00:00:21,017
(Bernadette:)No, you have to stop now.

7
00:00:21,556 --> 00:00:22,886
Bernadette!

8
00:00:23,057 --> 00:00:28,057
l wanna remind you, you promised
to take me dress-shopping tomorrow!

9
00:00:28,229 --> 00:00:30,569
(Bernadette:)Oh, damn.

10
00:00:31,941 --> 00:00:34,941
I'm sorry, I can't make it!

11
00:00:35,111 --> 00:00:38,701
But Sheldon's gonna go with you!

12
00:00:45,205 --> 00:00:47,625
(Bernadette:)And that's the last thing
you do to him.

13
00:00:51,795 --> 00:00:54,755
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Sheldon!

14
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:59,020
l need your help.

